              "body": "Fixed in the follow-up commit: the carrier descriptor allocates via vk_zalloc on cmd_buffer->vk.pool->alloc and releases via vk_free on the same allocator, in the draw path, the failure path, and release_recording. The installed cell IB and reference storage keep the install_ib ownership model shared with the device-internal emitters, whose allocations originate in common non-Vulkan code; folding those into the pool allocator is a follow-up spanning the private routes.",
